<section>
  <h2>What is Akram Vignan?</h2>
  <p>
    Akram Vignan is a direct and step-less path to Self-Realization,
    revealed by Param Pujya Dada Bhagwan. Unlike traditional gradual paths,
    Akram Vignan allows an individual to experience the Self through grace.
  </p>

  <p>
    Through the process of Gnan Vidhi, the seeker attains the awareness
    of the pure Soul while continuing worldly life with balance and harmony.
  </p>
